{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antenna Dilemma is a witty point-and-click adventure game in which you'll follow the story of C432632, a finicky grey cube that sure doesn't want to miss his favorite TV show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a media-driven society in which nothing else matters but TV, our hero is about to have a life-changing encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gone are the sofa and the remote control: for the first time of his life, C432632 is about to break out of his routine and set off, against his will, on an epic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853730/extras/fd45e738f28c6679eae9a23d5530b561.poster.avif?t=1756137479\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853730/extras/fd45e738f28c6679eae9a23d5530b561.webm?t=1756137479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853730/extras/fd45e738f28c6679eae9a23d5530b561.mp4?t=1756137479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853730/extras/cec1edd7ee1ce17bfa40d5eb74b28fc0.poster.avif?t=1756137479\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853730/extras/cec1edd7ee1ce17bfa40d5eb74b28fc0.webm?t=1756137479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853730/extras/cec1edd7ee1ce17bfa40d5eb74b28fc0.mp4?t=1756137479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A captivating story acclaimed by players, Antenna Dilemma takes you into a surprising dystopia. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure game inspired by the golden age of point and click adventure games: search every scene, find the right items to use, and solve logical puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadpan humour and (clever) puns, there's enough for everyone's taste!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853730?t=1756137479","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853730?t=1756137479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853730/01a0b22c7037564dd09a3613b25799d2ba4cd419/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756137479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853730/01a0b22c7037564dd09a3613b25799d2ba4cd419/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756137479","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antenna Dilemma is a witty point-and-click adventure game in which you'll follow the story of C432632, a finicky grey cube that sure doesn't want to miss his favorite TV show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a media-driven society in which nothing else matters but TV, our hero is about to have a life-changing encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gone are the sofa and the remote control: for the first time of his life, C432632 is about to break out of his routine and set off, against his will, on an epic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph